# 🎂 CIUX Birthday Assistant

## 📌 Project Overview

CIUX Birthday Assistant is a conversational AI application developed through five progressive versions (V1–V5). The project demonstrates the evolution of a chatbot from a simple rule-based system to an intelligent conversational assistant with Natural Language Understanding (NLU), Dialogue Management, Large Language Model (LLM) integration, and voice interaction.

The assistant helps users retrieve birthday-related information through natural language conversations.

## 🎯 Objectives

- Develop an interactive conversational birthday assistant.
- Understand user queries using Natural Language Understanding.
- Retrieve birthday information from a structured dataset.
- Improve conversational context handling.
- Integrate Large Language Models for improved query understanding.
- Enable voice-based interaction.

## 🚀 Project Evolution

### V1 – Basic Rule-Based Chatbot
- Basic chatbot interface.
- Rule-based query processing.
- Birthday information retrieval.
- Simple frontend and backend integration.

### V2 – Rule-Based NLU
- Improved natural language query understanding.
- Intent and entity identification.
- Structured query processing.
- Improved response generation.

### V3 – Dialogue Management
- Conversational context management.
- Context-aware responses.
- Follow-up question handling.
- Dialogue state tracking.

### V4 – LLM-Based NLU
- Large Language Model integration.
- Semantic query understanding.
- Structured output generation.
- Rule-based fallback.
- Data-grounded birthday responses.

### V5 – Voice Assistant
- Voice input.
- Speech recognition.
- Voice output.
- Text and voice conversational interaction.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python
- Flask
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Natural Language Understanding (NLU)
- Large Language Models (LLMs)
- Excel Dataset
- Git
- GitHub

